OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer barred for
OL,4,A'inappropriate' behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Kent Police officer has been
OL,7,Fbarred from policing after a misconduct
OL,8,Fpanel found he behaved inappropriately
OL,9,Ftowards a female colleague.
OL,11,FBen Basden, from Chatham, touched her
OL,12,Fwithout consent and sent her offensive
OL,13,Fmessages, the hearing was told.
OL,15,FBasden had joined Kent Police in August
OL,16,F2020 and was based in a local policing
OL,17,Fteam in north Kent before joining CID,
OL,18,Fthe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
