OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer barred for
OL,4,A'inappropriate' behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarrister Barney Branston told the
OL,7,Fpanel the first incident happened in
OL,8,FApril 2022, when Basden was tasked with
OL,9,Fsupervising a detained person at Darent
OL,10,FValley Hospital. He blew his colleague
OL,11,Fa kiss despite it being the first time
OL,12,Fthe pair had worked together, Branston
OL,13,Fsaid.
